<title>FRANCE: Algeria to build five-star hotel near Algiers.</title>
<headline>Algeria to build five-star hotel near Algiers.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Algeria is to build a five-star hotel at the Club des Pins seaside resort in the west of Algiers, the official Algerian news agency APS said on Monday.</p>
<p>APS, which gave no further details on the hotel, said the state-owned National Insurance Company will be shareholder in the hotel with 200 million dinars ($3.6 million) equity.</p>
<p>($1 = 56 dinars)</p>
</text>
